  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Under-investment remains a huge constraint for biodiversity conservation: the financing gap for the Philippine Biodiversity Strategy and Action Plan (PBSAP 2024-2040) is USD 1.24 billion/year . In response, the DENR BMB and UNDP initiated Phase II of the BIOFIN Project to build capacity and support various finance solutions. The following barriers remain to fully implement the National Biodiversity Finance Plan (NBFP): weak institutional capacities for resource mobilization; low public/private s</narrative>
  </description>
